'''Electric''' (formerly known as Electro) is a [[Fighting Styles|fighting style]] obtainable in the [[First Sea]] (or any other sea).

The style allows the user to conjure electric attacks through their hands, having some fairly decent damage, and being able to stun enemies. All of the moves are [[Area of Effect|AoE]] so that beginners can grind enemies, by grouping them up easily and hit them at once.

==Obtainment==
Electric can be learned for{{Money|500,000}} from the [[Mad Scientist]], which is located near [[Boat Dealer]] in [[Skylands]], Hot side of [[Hot and Cold|Hot And Cold]] in [[Second Sea]] and [[Castle on the Sea]] in [[Third Sea]].

==Mastery==
* '''300+ Mastery:''' Electric is one of the requirements to obtain [[Superhuman]] in [[Second Sea]] (or [[Third Sea]]).
* '''400+ Mastery:''' Electric can be "upgraded" to [[Electric Claw]] in [[Third Sea]].

