==Trivia==
* Due to having electrical properties, Electric cannot harm [[Rubber]] users due to [[Rubber]] being immune to electricity.
* While Electric is equipped, the user's hands will be covered in electricity, though this is purely cosmetic.
* There is a bug where if you try to re-equip it after buying it already, you still need {{Money|500,000}} to buy it.
* In the event that the insufficient money bug occurs, the user must have the [[Saber/Puzzle]] Relic in their inventory.
* The old version of Electric is used by the Shocker Enemy seen in [[Raids]].

